Note a simple calculator end note.
Say text Welcome to the calculator. end text
Ask the user for a number called first number.
Say text Now type plus, minus, times or divided. end text
Ask the user for operation.
Ask the user for a number called second number.
Set answer to nothing.
If operation is equal to text plus end text, then
  Set answer to first number plus second number.
end if.
If operation is equal to text minus end text, then
  Set answer to first number minus second number.
end if.
If operation is equal to text times end text, then
  Set answer to first number times second number.
end if.
If operation is equal to text divided end text, then
  Set answer to first number divided by second number.
end if.
If answer is equal to nothing, then
  Say text I only know plus, minus, times and divided. end text
otherwise
  Say text The answer is end text, answer.
end if.
